      },
      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-supreme-court-act-1933.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "The Master holds office on such terms and conditions (if any) in\nrelation to matters not provided by this Act as are determined, in\nwriting, by the Governor-General.",
