    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-supreme-court-act-1933-sec-37-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "37 All’ powers’ and ‘functions ‘exercisable’ by,’ and all ‘",
