      "skos:definition": "(4) The conditions referred to in the last preceding subsection may\ninclude a condition that copies of an affidavit by which any\nevidence is given be served on a party or parties to the matter and a\ncondition that a person whose evidence is given by affidavit attend\nat the hearing for cross examination.",
