      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-supreme-court-act-1933.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "The Supreme Court or the Judge may, in any suit or civil matter\npending in the Court, and at any stage of the proceedings:",
      "skos:definition": "The Supreme Court or the Judge may, in any suit or civil matter\npending in the Court, and at any stage of the proceedings:",
